{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-patterns","title":"现代模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"composable-architecture","title":"可组合架构（TCA / Composable Architecture）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/composable-architecture","wordCount":1095,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"mvi-redux-mobile","title":"MVI 与 Redux 移动端实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/mvi-redux-mobile","wordCount":1033,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"modularization-strategies","title":"模块化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/modularization-strategies","wordCount":1205,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 现代模式\n\n本章聚焦 2024-2026 年工业界最活跃的三类架构方向：以代数组合为核心的可组合架构（TCA）、以 Intent 驱动状态机的 MVI/Redux 家族、以及以模块边界为单位的模块化策略。它们并非替代经典模式，而是在经典模式之上叠加了更严格的约束——可组合性、可测试性、团队并行开发能力——来应对大规模移动应用的复杂度。\n"}